></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carkour</strong> is back in this expanded mode called<strong> Playground</strong>. It's basically a skatepark sandbox to drive around in doing stunts, completing challenges, and grabbing collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll be offering various playground maps as developers of the game, but we suspect that this mode will especially shine through the player-made maps using the <strong>level editor</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-to-point races, obstacle courses, tower climbs, meme objectives, psycho level challenges, combat arenas, or just somewhere to hang out with other flippable car friends - this mode will be a hell of a lot of fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475750/extras/06933c8477c3cd45e3cf576d8cb1b038.poster.avif?t=1786383638\" width=1170 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475750/extras/06933c8477c3cd45e3cf576d8cb1b038.webm?t=1786383638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475750/extras/06933c8477c3cd45e3cf576d8cb1b038.mp4?t=1786383638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For this GRIP follow-up, we wanted to go with a bit of a different <strong>art style</strong>, so we've taken the visuals in a  new direction from the original. It's kind of like how you thought your favourite childhood game looked like when you played it all those years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So GRIP XR's look is not quite retro, but definitely <strong>retro-inspired</strong>. 📺</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some other things to look forward to later in development:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ingame <strong>Workshop</strong> for sharing custom tracks + playgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car <strong>customization</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom<strong> tournament creator</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign</strong> with racer rivalries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique <strong>game modes</strong> and mutators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong> madness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We can't wait to get people into the level editor to start making their maps. It's going to be awesome. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "GRIP XR is a blazingly fast futuristic combat racing game with rocket-powered, flippable vehicles. Race with unique movement tech and use powerful weapons and abilities to beat your opponents to the finish line. Sequel to GRIP, a spiritual successor of the Rollcage games.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475750/932f09cd9526b105ac493471a7bdae3f87904f9b/header.jpg?t=1786383638", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475750/699da532073440e7db0784f15eea92c5c4ff26ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786383638", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475750/699da532073440e7db0784f15eea92c5c4ff26ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786383638", "website": "https://cagedelement.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4690K / AMD Ryzen 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 970 / AMD Radeon RX 470<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</